Prompt: Show total revenue by product brand for 2023 as a bar chart
Visualization goal: Bar chart showing total revenue per brand for 2023, ordered from highest to lowest


Tool selected: lookup_sales_data
[SalesDataAgent] Routing verso il nodo: lookup_sales_data

Generated SQL Query:
SELECT 
    p.brand, 
    SUM(s.Total_Sale_Value) AS total_revenue 
FROM sales s 
JOIN products p ON s.SKU_Coded = p.SKU_Coded 
WHERE EXTRACT(YEAR FROM s.Sold_Date) = 2023 
GROUP BY p.brand 
ORDER BY total_revenue DESC

